{"video":"UcqK4vypbC8","lines":[{"t":[0,4.6],"en":"-Coach!"},{"t":[4.6,8.4],"en":"-Michael just rented the Devil Wears Prada."},{"t":[8.4,11.2],"en":"He has his Netflix sent here to the office,"},{"t":[11.2,14.5],"en":"and he watches them in pieces when things are slow."},{"t":[14.5,18],"en":"-Steak!"},{"t":[18,20.1],"en":"Where's my steak?"},{"t":[20.1,21.7],"en":"-He's a big Meryl Streep fan,"},{"t":[21.7,23.9],"en":"so I shouldn't be surprised that he's identified"},{"t":[23.9,25.2],"en":"with her character."},{"t":[25.2,27.7],"en":"-Get me a money. -A suit?"},{"t":[27.7,29.9],"en":"-On the phone?"},{"t":[29.9,31.1],"en":"-Like the main company number,"},{"t":[31.1,32.4],"en":"'cause I'm gonna have to call information."},{"t":[32.4,34.2],"en":"-Where's Armani? He's on the phone."},{"t":[34.2,35.3],"en":"Too slow."},{"t":[35.3,37.3],"en":"-You're not going to Paris."},{"t":[37.3,39.5],"en":"I'm so much better than you are."},{"t":[53,55.1],"en":"-I owe you an apology."},{"t":[55.1,56.4],"en":"-You finished the movie."},{"t":[56.4,57.7],"en":"-Yeah, it was awesome."},{"t":[57.7,59.1],"en":"Big surprise ending."},{"t":[59.1,60.2],"en":"Won't ruin it for you."},{"t":[60.2,62],"en":"-No, go ahead."},{"t":[62,63.8],"en":"-Meryl Streep is the bad guy."},{"t":[63.8,64.9],"en":"You never see it coming."},{"t":[64.9,68.9],"en":"Anyway, if I was mean in any way to you,"},{"t":[68.9,71.1],"en":"I'm sorry."},{"t":[71.1,73.2],"en":"I just want what's best for you, Manushka."},{"t":[79.2,80.4],"en":"-Makushla!"},{"t":[80.4,82.2],"en":"He's watching \"Million Dollar Baby.\""},{"t":[85.6,86.8],"en":"He's gonna try to kill me."}]}
